WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:07.680
But I also think you're amazing for being able 
to care about what's important to you,

00:07.680 --> 00:09.990
even if it hurts you.

00:11.780 --> 00:13.700
Mukai-kun...

00:14.910 --> 00:16.150
Show me your hand.

00:17.690 --> 00:21.510
I mean, yeah, when I was starting the fire...

00:23.030 --> 00:25.470
<i>He did that for me?</i>

00:27.200 --> 00:29.800
Mukai-kun, why?!

00:32.960 --> 00:36.410
<i>I won't be able to hold back!</i>

00:58.680 --> 01:01.880
<i>I took it way too far this time!</i>

01:01.880 --> 01:04.070
Shino-san?

01:06.560 --> 01:08.340
What was...

01:08.960 --> 01:11.420
W-Well...

01:11.420 --> 01:14.510
<i>Wh-Wh-Wh-What should I tell him?</i>

01:14.510 --> 01:16.460
No, er...

01:17.150 --> 01:19.770
Th-That was my first time, so...

01:20.240 --> 01:21.600
I meant...

01:21.600 --> 01:26.090
<i>Where's my top-of-grade brain when I need it?!</i>

01:35.990 --> 01:47.960
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

02:58.980 --> 03:02.360
<i>I-I need to make something up!</i>

03:02.910 --> 03:06.460
I think you're so caught up 
in hiding your own feelings

03:06.460 --> 03:10.830
that you've lost sight of 
something more important.

03:13.040 --> 03:14.310
<i>Or maybe...</i>

03:14.800 --> 03:17.930
<i>Maybe I should just tell him how I really feel?</i>

03:22.390 --> 03:23.460
<i>I'm scared.</i>

03:24.280 --> 03:25.740
Shino-san?

03:28.200 --> 03:32.950
<i>But if I don't tell him now, 
I don't think I'll ever be able to.</i>

03:34.510 --> 03:35.620
Mukai-kun!

03:36.940 --> 03:39.770
I actually...

03:44.600 --> 03:46.730
I-I've always...

03:46.730 --> 03:49.000
H-H-Hang on, Shino-san!

03:49.000 --> 03:50.010
No!

03:50.010 --> 03:51.290
I'm not waiting anymore!

03:51.290 --> 03:52.790
I mean...

03:53.100 --> 03:54.120
You're naked!

04:01.340 --> 04:02.700
Sorry for looking!

04:02.700 --> 04:03.930
Shush!

04:10.630 --> 04:12.810
<i>What am I doing?</i>

04:12.810 --> 04:16.540
<i>Why am I always like this 
in front of Mukai-kun?</i>

04:17.430 --> 04:21.350
Was that another one of 
your accidents just now?

04:22.040 --> 04:24.220
Like, your hand slipped or something?

04:26.660 --> 04:27.820
I thought so.

04:28.310 --> 04:30.740
I can't imagine you would have 
done that on purpose.

04:32.610 --> 04:33.670
Yeah.

04:35.330 --> 04:37.050
<i>This is fine.</i>

04:37.600 --> 04:40.340
<i>Our relationship would never 
go anywhere anyway.</i>

04:42.230 --> 04:45.630
<i>I'm just going to stay the way I am.</i>

04:47.650 --> 04:49.560
Warm up by the fire.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.450
I'm going to gather more wood.

04:52.520 --> 04:53.980
It wasn't an accident.

05:03.360 --> 05:04.280
Huh?

05:05.220 --> 05:08.260
Shino-san?

05:09.240 --> 05:11.120
Do you mean...

05:16.900 --> 05:18.550
What do you...

05:22.050 --> 05:23.290
Shino-san!

05:27.430 --> 05:28.470
Saki-san!

05:29.560 --> 05:30.970
They're nowhere to be found!

05:30.970 --> 05:32.930
And they left their phones here!

05:34.160 --> 05:35.340
Naoya...

05:35.340 --> 05:36.490
Shino...

05:36.890 --> 05:38.330
Damn it, Forehead!

05:36.890 --> 05:43.610
<i>Girlfriend, Girlfriend</i>

05:38.330 --> 05:41.260
She ran off with him!

05:41.260 --> 05:43.000
Where are you?!

05:45.240 --> 05:47.570
Naoya-kun!

05:47.850 --> 05:50.150
Shino-san!

05:50.920 --> 05:52.770
Hey, where's Saki?!

05:52.770 --> 05:53.880
Mirika-san.

05:53.880 --> 05:56.280
Saki-san is searching over there.

05:56.280 --> 05:57.620
This is bad.

05:59.230 --> 06:03.550
Someone saw two people who looked like 
Naoya and Shino get washed away.

06:20.150 --> 06:21.520
It's no use.

06:21.520 --> 06:23.650
Her fever just keeps getting worse.

06:25.490 --> 06:28.750
I-It's just a cold.

06:28.750 --> 06:31.120
It was chilly last night.

06:33.120 --> 06:35.990
Sorry for causing so much trouble.

06:37.080 --> 06:39.900
And I kept you up all night to take care of me.

06:39.900 --> 06:42.040
It's not your fault!

06:43.490 --> 06:47.540
You really are kind, Mukai-kun.

06:48.160 --> 06:52.150
You aren't even asking me about last night.

06:53.380 --> 06:54.970
Shino-san...

06:57.030 --> 06:59.450
I'm sure the others are worried.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.940
Let's head back.

07:01.940 --> 07:03.550
Don't move!

07:03.550 --> 07:06.650
I'll swim back and call for help.

07:07.020 --> 07:08.820
B-But...

07:09.860 --> 07:14.600
I can't keep causing you trouble...

07:19.830 --> 07:21.220
Shino-san!

07:22.840 --> 07:25.460
Sh-She's sweating so much.

07:25.920 --> 07:28.220
Are you all right, Shino-san?

07:30.770 --> 07:32.630
Does she have heat stroke, too?

07:33.020 --> 07:37.100
Right, she hasn't had anything
 to drink since last night, either.

07:38.600 --> 07:40.340
<i>My body's burning up.</i>

07:41.120 --> 07:42.680
<i>I feel sick.</i>

07:43.890 --> 07:51.540
<i>After I dove into the water, I caught 
a cold, and now I have heat stroke.</i>

07:52.210 --> 07:54.900
<i>I'm a total nuisance to Mukai-kun.</i>

07:56.210 --> 08:01.500
<i>Even if I tell him how I feel now...</i>

08:12.560 --> 08:13.960
Mukai-kun...

08:14.950 --> 08:16.480
What are you...

08:16.480 --> 08:19.060
I'm going to haul you back to the beach.

08:20.560 --> 08:22.640
But it's pretty far.

08:22.640 --> 08:24.020
It's dangerous.

08:24.020 --> 08:27.910
If it's heat stroke, you need to 
get to the hospital quickly!

08:29.480 --> 08:32.900
I can't just leave you behind to get help!

08:34.360 --> 08:36.950
We don't have time for that!

08:38.170 --> 08:39.320
But...

08:40.280 --> 08:42.910
I want to help you!

08:43.300 --> 08:45.290
Mukai-kun...

08:46.610 --> 08:50.070
Don't mind me!

08:50.720 --> 08:52.210
I'll be fine!

08:55.650 --> 08:56.810
<i>Mukai-kun...</i>

08:57.220 --> 09:00.840
<i>I'm going to try harder.</i>

09:00.840 --> 09:02.890
<i>I'm going to be more honest.</i>

09:03.750 --> 09:07.690
<i>I just want to be with you more!</i>

09:26.390 --> 09:30.300
I passed out at some point, and...

09:31.750 --> 09:32.980
Mukai-kun!

09:36.660 --> 09:38.020
Are you all right?

09:40.150 --> 09:40.890
Yeah.

09:41.810 --> 09:42.970
Good.

09:43.750 --> 09:47.100
Well, let's get back to the others.

09:47.840 --> 09:49.980
Y-Yeah.

09:51.700 --> 09:56.690
But first, about last night...

09:56.690 --> 09:58.820
Naoya! Shino!

10:02.880 --> 10:04.280
Naoya!

10:08.550 --> 10:10.640
Naoya! Are you okay?

10:10.640 --> 10:11.340
Please!

10:11.730 --> 10:14.420
S-Saki-chan...

10:14.840 --> 10:16.950
Sorry for worrying you.

10:17.970 --> 10:19.340
I'm all right.

10:19.810 --> 10:21.400
Thank goodness!

10:25.120 --> 10:26.440
Seriously...

10:29.160 --> 10:33.230
<i>I've never seen Sakisaki make such a face.</i>

10:33.660 --> 10:38.570
I've been looking for you since yesterday.

10:38.910 --> 10:41.460
I heard you got washed away.

10:42.420 --> 10:46.540
<i>I had it all so wrong.</i>

10:48.790 --> 10:52.600
I kept thinking, what if 
something happened to you?

10:52.600 --> 10:54.000
Sorry.

10:54.520 --> 11:00.250
Is Sakisaki really serious about Mukai-kun?

11:01.000 --> 11:05.350
Please don't disappear on me anymore!

11:06.150 --> 11:12.350
<i>Maybe I'm more serious about 
Mukai-kun than Sakisaki is.</i>

11:37.510 --> 11:40.550
<i>I'm an idiot.</i>

11:44.740 --> 11:47.220
I'm so sorry for worrying you!

11:47.520 --> 11:49.960
I'll do anything to make it up to you!

11:49.960 --> 11:52.940
Whatever. You're safe. It's fine.

11:53.350 --> 11:55.040
Saki-chan, I'm sorry!

11:53.830 --> 11:56.550
I'm glad they're both back 
to their normal selves.

11:55.040 --> 11:56.480
It's okay.

11:56.480 --> 11:57.530
It's not okay!

11:57.530 --> 11:58.200
Come on...

11:58.200 --> 11:59.110
I'm sorry!

11:59.110 --> 12:03.840
Besides, I mean, we got to kiss in the end.

12:03.840 --> 12:05.340
It all worked out.

12:07.110 --> 12:08.820
You got to what?

12:09.580 --> 12:12.360
Er, well...

12:12.580 --> 12:14.040
<b>Blush</b>

12:16.300 --> 12:19.280
Why are you acting all weird?

12:19.280 --> 12:20.890
Nah...

12:21.880 --> 12:24.360
A-Are we?

12:27.050 --> 12:29.640
You two didn't kiss, did you?!

12:31.400 --> 12:36.230
Nah, well... how should I put it...

12:37.460 --> 12:38.730
What do you think?

12:38.730 --> 12:40.060
You're pissing me off!

12:40.060 --> 12:41.690
You obviously did!

12:43.300 --> 12:45.210
Congratulations!

12:45.210 --> 12:46.680
Naw...

12:49.250 --> 12:52.550
Hey, I told you to stop them from kissing!

12:59.490 --> 13:01.180
Right, you did.

13:01.180 --> 13:02.170
I'm sorry.

13:05.970 --> 13:08.570
So, what was it like?

13:09.250 --> 13:10.740
Tasted salty.

13:11.930 --> 13:14.020
Damn it!

13:14.440 --> 13:17.220
Go take the lovey-dovey stuff outside!

13:15.890 --> 13:17.220
Hey!

13:20.560 --> 13:24.650
Look at her, getting all pouty 
because I kissed Naoya.

13:30.980 --> 13:32.540
What happened?

13:32.540 --> 13:33.330
Huh?

13:33.330 --> 13:37.420
I told you I'd reveal that you 
like Naoya if you didn't stop them.

13:38.310 --> 13:39.500
Well...

13:39.770 --> 13:42.730
You washed up on that 
island with him, didn't you?

13:42.730 --> 13:44.980
What happened there?

13:48.500 --> 13:52.140
Basically, in the end, it amounted to nothing.

13:52.930 --> 13:55.890
I stumbled and he saw my boobs, as usual.

13:55.890 --> 13:59.770
It's actually amazing that 
that counts as nothing!

14:01.330 --> 14:02.770
We held hands.

14:04.720 --> 14:08.700
We were naked back-to-back, 
sitting by a campfire.

14:12.240 --> 14:14.370
We kissed, though.

14:14.370 --> 14:16.710
How dare you?!

14:17.940 --> 14:19.210
What the hell?!

14:19.210 --> 14:21.260
I don't know why I worried about you!

14:21.260 --> 14:22.540
I wanna beat you up!

14:23.190 --> 14:25.240
Did you do sexy stuff, too?

14:25.240 --> 14:26.630
No!

14:29.540 --> 14:32.300
Wait, so you confessed, then?

14:36.520 --> 14:39.480
Man, I'm starving.

14:39.480 --> 14:42.110
Hey, wanna go eat somewhere?

14:42.110 --> 14:43.520
Sounds good.

14:43.520 --> 14:44.440
Yeah.

14:44.440 --> 14:48.270
Since we're here, I wanna have 
something you couldn't get elsewhere.

14:48.270 --> 14:51.040
Like Okinawa soba or taco rice.

14:51.040 --> 14:53.290
I wonder if Shino-san's good to go out.

14:53.290 --> 14:56.840
Yeah, let's go ask if she's all right.

14:59.400 --> 15:01.950
So did you confess or not?

15:01.950 --> 15:03.320
Which is it?

15:05.300 --> 15:07.050
I tried to.

15:08.050 --> 15:09.590
It wasn't an accident.

15:11.120 --> 15:14.720
But right after, I got sick.

15:15.760 --> 15:18.740
And Mukai-kun carried me all the way here.

15:20.600 --> 15:24.690
And then, when we got back 
and I saw Sakisaki crying...

15:25.120 --> 15:26.680
Naoya!

15:28.160 --> 15:30.810
I was taken aback.

15:31.590 --> 15:34.070
So I never ended up telling him.

15:35.330 --> 15:42.310
I thought Sakisaki wasn't really 
serious about Mukai-kun,

15:42.310 --> 15:43.620
but it seems I was wrong.

15:44.730 --> 15:46.290
Are you serious?

15:48.230 --> 15:49.540
It's fine now.

15:54.220 --> 15:56.430
Shino, hey...

15:56.830 --> 15:58.430
Good timing.

15:58.430 --> 16:01.270
There's something I want you all to hear, too.

16:03.800 --> 16:07.690
I'm leaving school.

16:10.040 --> 16:13.360
I'm leaving to transfer to another school.

16:18.740 --> 16:22.470
T-Transfer?

16:23.080 --> 16:25.040
Sh-Shino-san...

16:25.040 --> 16:26.080
You...

16:26.080 --> 16:27.120
Uh-huh.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.250
S-Saki-chan?

16:28.250 --> 16:31.340
How can you be so calm?

16:31.340 --> 16:32.490
Sakisaki,

16:33.710 --> 16:35.300
I'm not joking or anything.

16:35.830 --> 16:37.260
No way!

16:38.340 --> 16:40.840
But what for?

16:44.900 --> 16:49.050
I don't think I should be 
around you guys anymore.

16:49.050 --> 16:50.440
Why not?!

16:51.620 --> 16:53.120
I'll catch your stupidity.

16:53.120 --> 16:55.410
It could affect my future.

16:55.410 --> 16:57.800
I think you're already infected.

16:57.800 --> 16:59.240
All the more reason, then.

16:59.240 --> 17:01.450
Aren't you going to deny being stupid?

17:01.870 --> 17:04.400
This is so sudden, though.

17:04.400 --> 17:06.170
Did something happen?

17:07.250 --> 17:08.520
Shino-san...

17:10.230 --> 17:12.280
I've been doing some thinking.

17:12.280 --> 17:14.470
About what, though?!

17:14.470 --> 17:16.180
Come on, Shino!

17:17.380 --> 17:20.300
Anyway, I've made up my mind.

17:21.750 --> 17:23.420
Shino...

17:24.140 --> 17:29.060
We probably won't see each other much 
anymore, so take care of Mukai-kun.

17:30.500 --> 17:33.030
Thanks for everything.

17:36.630 --> 17:38.230
Shino-san...

17:39.740 --> 17:42.860
Well, I'll be taking the next flight home.

17:42.860 --> 17:44.410
Enjoy your stay.

17:48.110 --> 17:51.430
Hold it, washboard.

17:52.610 --> 17:53.760
What?

17:53.760 --> 17:58.560
Do you really think I'm going to be 
satisfied with that half-assed excuse?

17:58.560 --> 18:00.250
S-Saki-chan...

18:00.250 --> 18:02.350
What's your problem?

18:02.350 --> 18:09.060
I won't put up with your bullshit forever, 
you boobless, psycho loli-bait bitch!

18:09.060 --> 18:11.270
She's completely lost it!

18:13.280 --> 18:18.240
Speak up, or I'm kneading 
these goofy breasts to a pulp!

18:18.650 --> 18:19.450
Hey!

18:19.450 --> 18:20.910
Why her breasts?

18:20.910 --> 18:23.550
S-Saki-chan, relax!

18:23.550 --> 18:25.370
Out of my way!

18:25.370 --> 18:27.960
I don't know what you're hiding,

18:28.330 --> 18:32.080
but don't go thinking I'm gonna let you 
get away with keeping it a secret!

18:32.080 --> 18:33.290
That's just stupid!

18:33.290 --> 18:35.050
You're stupid!

18:35.050 --> 18:37.050
Stupid!

18:37.050 --> 18:39.360
Your insults are way too weak!

18:39.360 --> 18:40.640
Shut up!

18:40.640 --> 18:43.740
I guess you have neither boobs 
nor an imagination!

18:43.740 --> 18:45.770
Lame!

18:46.120 --> 18:49.060
You don't have much yourself, either.

18:49.850 --> 18:52.010
I'll do as I please!

18:52.440 --> 18:55.280
And I'll interrogate you as I please!

18:55.280 --> 18:56.360
I don't want to tell you!

18:56.360 --> 18:57.820
Then I'm not letting go!

18:58.110 --> 18:59.670
Why are you so...

19:00.290 --> 19:01.780
Leave me alone!

19:02.060 --> 19:06.830
I'd rather fight you to hold you back 
than leave without knowing why!

19:06.830 --> 19:08.450
You're my friend!

19:21.430 --> 19:22.720
Hold it!

19:22.720 --> 19:25.020
Calm down for a second, Saki-chan!

19:25.020 --> 19:26.460
Let me go, Naoya!

19:26.460 --> 19:27.930
Damn it!

19:27.930 --> 19:31.260
Eek! I'm being raped!

19:31.260 --> 19:33.460
H-Hey, don't!

19:31.260 --> 19:33.910
Someone!

19:44.790 --> 19:47.830
Sakisaki, you idiot.

19:58.500 --> 20:01.680
You tried to bail without 
revealing your feelings.

20:01.680 --> 20:03.620
And then Saki snapped at you.

20:04.720 --> 20:07.220
What exactly are you trying to do?

20:12.130 --> 20:16.530
If you're feeling guilty about
 telling Naoya how you feel,

20:16.530 --> 20:19.240
not saying anything was bad enough.

20:19.240 --> 20:21.240
How did you not figure that out?

20:26.610 --> 20:28.030
You're dumb.

20:37.770 --> 20:39.420
Ugly crying?!

20:39.960 --> 20:42.110
There, there, I'm sorry.

20:42.110 --> 20:43.930
Good girl.

20:44.660 --> 20:46.470
You're throwing me off.

20:49.890 --> 20:50.970
You're right.

20:51.400 --> 20:54.360
I didn't think she'd get so angry.

20:54.940 --> 20:57.480
I'd rather fight you to hold you back!

20:57.480 --> 20:59.150
You're my friend!

21:00.660 --> 21:04.500
Sakisaki actually confronted me, 
and so sincerely.

21:05.250 --> 21:07.120
She said we're friends.

21:08.960 --> 21:10.080
But...

21:10.840 --> 21:16.470
It's because we're friends that 
I can't tell her I like Mukai-kun.

21:18.770 --> 21:21.610
That I've been hiding my feelings all along...

21:22.230 --> 21:24.870
That I was only trying to get 
them to stop two-timing

21:25.640 --> 21:30.790
so I could move on, not because 
I was worried about Sakisaki.

21:33.630 --> 21:38.180
That I kissed Mukai-kun.

21:40.600 --> 21:43.800
I've hurt her so much.

21:49.600 --> 21:57.110
So no matter what Sakisaki thinks, 
it's better if I leave without saying anything.

21:58.690 --> 22:01.430
I just need to let go of Mukai-kun.

22:01.430 --> 22:02.700
That's all.

22:06.050 --> 22:07.560
Shino...

22:11.080 --> 22:12.100
So...

22:13.350 --> 22:14.540
Goodbye.

22:21.980 --> 22:26.990
<b>Her Resolve, and Then</b>

23:57.520 --> 23:59.700
Next episode preview, but it's on Risapon TV!

23:59.700 --> 24:01.600
I guess this is the last stream, huh?

24:01.600 --> 24:03.070
Wait, I just got a huge super chat!

24:03.070 --> 24:03.880
Let's see...

24:03.880 --> 24:06.340
It's from "I Love You, Saki-oneechan."

24:06.340 --> 24:08.410
Yes! My favorite streamer said she loves me!

24:08.410 --> 24:09.130
Saki-san?!

24:09.130 --> 24:11.770
You're a serious whale, aren't you?
